{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0286_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0286_story_05_title", "source_sha256": "b5c8294539064b6c6bbfb460dc630d3fb0b9047dc68e6b173d074e29fabb2829", "ja": "ただ、伝わるもの", "zh": "纯粹传达之物", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0286_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0286_story_05_synopsis", "source_sha256": "38ed91b2f6d09adff74f141b4ca96d415d78801faaca511263b46432c0d818be", "ja": "インタビューの答えに悩む静香は、プロデュ\nーサーと共に、春香の取材を見学する事に。\nそこで春香の『好きなことを続けたかった』\nという素直な言葉を聞いた静香は、何を伝え\nればいいかのヒントを得るのだった。", "zh": "为采访的回答而烦恼的静香，决定和制作人一起去旁观春香接受采访。\n在那里听到春香“想继续做自己喜欢的事”这句坦率的话后，静香得到了该传达些什么的提示。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0286_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0286_story_05_1000_p", "source_sha256": "2b02385c751b804b9e95edcb75419ec3901299d64ccf69095a5b2bbc78d0d5cd", "ja": "（今日の取材は、春香のインタビューから。\n春香本人の提案で、劇場外で行うことになった）", "zh": "（今天的采访先从春香的采访开始。应春香本人的提议，安排在剧场外进行。）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0286_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0286_story_05_1001_p", "source_sha256": "2f398dcdca5f17275a0d9a227b95c4dc16e9a9d9eb822a22953037085512b547", "ja": "おーい静香、こっちこっち！", "zh": "喂，静香，这边这边！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0286_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0286_story_05_1002_015siz", "source_sha256": "4ff01c4ae3e8a69ea047def7f1237d144d8e81a33855d5ece21718b595bae211", "ja": "もう、{$P$}！\nそんな大声出さなくても、聞こえてますから！", "zh": "真是的，{$P$}！\n不用喊那么大声，我也听得见啦！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0286_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0286_story_05_1003_015siz", "source_sha256": "3eced1a35599bcf3814069203d5ba60e931a869d63fa40ff550ba41579d502d9", "ja": "あの、春香さん、今日は見学させてもらいます。\nよろしくお願いします！", "zh": "那个，春香前辈，我今天来向您观摩学习。\n请多指教！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0286_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0286_story_05_1004_001har", "source_sha256": "a8b565ad2e6042f7d4018445747c5f5302d7304db558c15ffa29d1276aff3af7", "ja": "こちらこそよろしくね、静香ちゃん！\nようこそ、私の思い出の場所へ……なーんて♪", "zh": "我才要请你多多指教呢，静香！\n欢迎来到我充满回忆的地方……开玩笑的♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0286_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0286_story_05_1005_015siz", "source_sha256": "1e9a75ac712085f9630866ccf867629c72915c6e9e7d4200542dab3cc3a4559f", "ja": "春香さんの、思い出の場所……ですか？", "zh": "春香小姐的，回忆之地……吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0286_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0286_story_05_1006_001har", "source_sha256": "ba414de5514065eee48875f93c9f5adc047a8e79d5d6435582bb18ddf521b32d", "ja": "うん、私のお気に入りの公園！　いつも一緒に\n歌を歌ってくれた、大好きなお姉さんがいたんだ。", "zh": "嗯，是我很喜欢的那座公园！以前有个我很喜欢的大姐姐，\n总是会跟我一起唱歌呢。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0286_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0286_story_05_1007_p", "source_sha256": "839f067d5e3370aecfe30c10a410917bfd255a2ed9d199593c588c05087519be", "ja": "以前、雑誌の取材の時にも言ってたよな。\n春香の憧れの人だったんだよな。", "zh": "以前接受杂志采访时，你也说过吧。\n那个人曾是春香憧憬的对象。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0286_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0286_story_05_1008_015siz", "source_sha256": "eedc620c0344c9b51588d762e854ed38ae2bd275643f60127524262c983dda22", "ja": "春香さんにも、そういう人がいたんですね……。", "zh": "原来春香小姐也有这样的人啊……。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0286_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0286_story_05_1009_001har", "source_sha256": "1f0bb4ad8ea3ebc621c493d03574349d3d636017af55c45918a41de7b28b09ee", "ja": "うん！　他にもね、友達が集まってくれて、\n歌を聴いてもらったりとかして。", "zh": "嗯！还有啊，朋友们也聚过来，听我唱歌什么的。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0286_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0286_story_05_1010_001har", "source_sha256": "649a43e148fe5328dc9025a1df4b45a4cdc55e8e7e383a159fd8fbd29e2c300f", "ja": "友達の前で、覚えたばっかりの歌を歌って……\nちょっぴり緊張したけど、楽しかったなぁ。", "zh": "在朋友们面前唱刚学会的歌……\n虽然有点紧张，但真的很开心。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0286_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0286_story_05_1011_015siz", "source_sha256": "324fc9719831bfe17d788e040ae196aff29c08b985ed904e3d02ac775c598ca6", "ja": "公園が、春香さんにとっての\n最初のステージだったんですね……。", "zh": "对春香小姐来说，公园就是她最初的舞台呢……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0286_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0286_story_05_1012_p", "source_sha256": "60979eceda8f14e335e484ed6f4cc3031576b034a057a3fcdc6dcbd324525291", "ja": "確かに、そうとも言えるな。春香の初ライブが\n見られたなんて、その友達が羨ましいな。", "zh": "确实，也可以这么说。能看到春香的第一场演出，真羡慕那个朋友啊。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0286_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0286_story_05_1013_001har", "source_sha256": "cea9fd191cf2951ccc6bbb2d24ee4a969c102c5b4cf9fab7b4be8060db7fb910", "ja": "えへへ……。……その時は、友達もお姉さんも、\nたくさん褒めてくれて。", "zh": "嘿嘿……那时候，朋友和姐姐都夸了我好多。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0286_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0286_story_05_1014_001har", "source_sha256": "697dbdc9c414b84283e81c8c582312bccaa419fcab7135205aa5695ebab3e85e", "ja": "私、それがとってもうれしくて……。\nもっともっと歌いたいなって思ったの。", "zh": "我那时真的好开心……。\n就觉得还想唱啊，还想唱更多。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0286_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0286_story_05_1015_015siz", "source_sha256": "ac67272206dd429b3c179ccc20810edae2afeaee9f00feb8a1b58126d811691b", "ja": "そうだったんですね……。けど、\n春香さんの気持ち、ちょっとわかるな。", "zh": "原来是这样啊……不过，春香的心情，我也有点明白了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0286_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0286_story_05_1016_015siz", "source_sha256": "1080b17e95f2798dba782ea731f99f30f511272fd055b59dcb5ee98716696198", "ja": "褒めてもらえると、やっぱりうれしいですし……\nもっとがんばろうって気持ちになりますよね。", "zh": "被人夸奖，还是会很开心的……\n会让人觉得要更加努力呢。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0286_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0286_story_05_1017_001har", "source_sha256": "6d366bfeae8a75a012b5365b7acf4d595a5ca0f1bf48e3daeb7b2e93ca98a5f6", "ja": "うん♪　きっとね、あの時の思い出があったから、\n今もアイドルを続けているんだと思うんだ。", "zh": "嗯♪我想，一定是因为有那时候的回忆，\n所以现在也还在继续当偶像吧。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0286_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0286_story_05_1018_001har", "source_sha256": "ad7a79b02361a0be2769ce266e60c850184683837f44d7b6c702688b87ca15af", "ja": "上手に歌えるかとか、そういうのは関係なくて……\n大好きな歌を、ずーっと歌いたい。", "zh": "唱得好不好什么的，其实都不重要……\n我只是想一直唱着自己最喜欢的歌。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0286_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0286_story_05_1019_001har", "source_sha256": "bb36fdb60dd9ead29d7c012bb79dc18f60943aab32076884abcb6afc6b4d189a", "ja": "もちろん、アイドルがお仕事になって。変わった\nところもあるけど……私の気持ちは、ずっと同じ。", "zh": "当然，偶像成了工作之后，也是有些地方改变了……但我的心情，一直都没有变。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0286_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0286_story_05_1020_015siz", "source_sha256": "83ed9b8fee1dc0cf0d2d49efe661f78dbf0f87791b068cc8c8324d6811d44577", "ja": "春香さん……。", "zh": "春香小姐……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0286_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0286_story_05_1022_staff", "source_sha256": "6b42838d7645882e272f9ef4379f99c5bf7013a78c090a8dec5d673915470408", "ja": "なるほど。大好きなことを続けたかった……それが、\n天海さんがアイドルになった理由なんですね。", "zh": "原来如此。想继续做自己最喜欢的事……这就是天海小姐成为偶像的理由啊。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0286_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0286_story_05_1023_001har", "source_sha256": "866cf226200c125bf1ced7951b260d1a80b90913c2132c211f484ec9e2a53fac", "ja": "そうですね！　自分でも単純だなって思いますけど、\n私らしいかなって……。", "zh": "是啊！我自己也觉得这个理由挺简单的，不过……这也很像我的作风吧……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0286_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0286_story_05_1024_001har", "source_sha256": "bb47f5015de8f97dad3a74d909dec687aefae33b5a6db39873ae7a56834d0d75", "ja": "私は、特別なところなんてない、\n普通の女の子です。でも……。", "zh": "我是个没有什么特别之处的普通女孩。不过……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0286_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0286_story_05_1025_001har", "source_sha256": "70e087ee8b387e4a3176494301acb5592d3cfccc84470de52c87e6f6a994c42c", "ja": "アイドルになって気づいたんです。好きって気持ちと、\n歌い続けたいって思いがあれば、大丈夫なんだって♪", "zh": "成为偶像后我才发现，只要心中有喜欢的感情，以及想一直唱下去的愿望，就没问题了♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0286_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0286_story_05_1026_001har", "source_sha256": "bd7595b9c31a9adeec510a2f16655e1c0438497fe31f8a5173d76e0cfd10b200", "ja": "だからこれからも、その気持ちを大切にして、\nアイドルをずっと続けられたらいいなって思います！", "zh": "所以今后，我也想一直珍惜这份心情，继续当偶像就好了！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0286_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0286_story_05_1028_p", "source_sha256": "13a9aff2a3f8113f89cfeae9064c279ccd6cd4cabd519a6658ca624968c700c3", "ja": "……。\nいいインタビューだよな。", "zh": "……。\n这采访做得不错啊。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0286_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0286_story_05_1029_015siz", "source_sha256": "18c70dc5124049721692da5b791540c2592859f656387280eca1f4def6b1ad5a", "ja": "はい。とてもシンプルで……。\nだからこそ、春香さんの気持ちが伝わってきました。", "zh": "是的。非常简洁……\n正因如此，才能感受到春香小姐的心情。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0286_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0286_story_05_1030_015siz", "source_sha256": "30d2ec84ca029d56f4367d6e758c02538b9a1b3ba768989174cf94b0e3d1beca", "ja": "ただ、歌が好きだったから……って。", "zh": "只是因为喜欢唱歌……而已。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0286_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0286_story_05_1031_p", "source_sha256": "d2c94693a6ec6097fee1d37fd753125f7173c60ad65f3fcd747399e6fb91618e", "ja": "そうだな。シンプルだ。\nでも、簡単なことじゃないよな。好きでいることは。", "zh": "是啊，很简单。\n不过，喜欢这件事，并不容易。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0286_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0286_story_05_1032_015siz", "source_sha256": "9b0d16d43ddc5f82a35b2cafcdc8a0a028ee925305a2e18846a011ed2552b4a2", "ja": "そうですね。私……\nもしかしたら、難しく考えすぎてたのかもしれません。", "zh": "是啊。我……\n或许是把事情想得太复杂了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0286_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0286_story_05_1033_015siz", "source_sha256": "114d75361803cd78f0636da566da4948380dd59e4e99b43156b3c6b37c58cbbc", "ja": "憧れてくれている人の、期待に応えたい。\nだから、立派なことを言わなきゃ……って。", "zh": "我想回应那些憧憬着我的人的期待。\n所以，必须说些了不起的话才行……想着。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0286_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0286_story_05_1034_p", "source_sha256": "8fc25b33156d7376b9cc9eed906493f55ff15dafb18155e3f0cf917c541101b1", "ja": "そうだな。アイドルに憧れる子に、\nどんな言葉を届ければいいか……いや。", "zh": "是啊。对于憧憬偶像的孩子，该传达怎样的话……不对。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0286_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0286_story_05_1035_p", "source_sha256": "cab8d0e7a8f6f383286b73b59a939189b0f61a2757197f95c662bf811361b3a3", "ja": "どんなことを言われたら、嬉しいか。\nそれは静香が、一番わかってるんじゃないかな？", "zh": "如果有人对自己说些什么，会感到高兴。\n这件事，静香应该是最清楚的吧？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
